※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4615 LANG_ARENA_VALUE_GIVEN_BACK

※ An element is part of its array, so an element given something made in an arena makes the
※ array hold it, as a field does its record.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let s: mut arena = ⎕arena
    let v: mut str⟦2⟧ = ⟦"-", "-"⟧
    v⟦0⟧ ← "a" ⧺ "b" in s
    ⎕empty(s)
    if v⟦0⟧ = "ab": 0u6 else: 1u6
